@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Monospace

cloud "Internet" as internet
cloud "Docker Hub" as dockerhub
rectangle "AWS CloudFormation\nStack: aws-cf-stack-nequi" as cfn

node "AWS VPC" as vpc {
  node "Subred Pública" as pub {
    node "EC2 t3.micro\nAmazon Linux" as ec2 {
      node "Docker Compose" as compose
      node "Contenedor: Franchise API" as api {
        package "Arquitectura interna" as capas {
          package "Infrastructure (Technology Concrete Components)" as infra {
            package "Entry Points" as ep {
              component "Web EndPoints\n(RouterRest/Handler)" as web
              component "Scheduler" as scheduler
              component "Message Boxes" as msg
            }
            package "Domain" as dom {
              component "UseCase" as uc
              component "Entities (Model and Ports)" as entports
            }
            package "Gateways" as gws {
              component "Entities Repository\n(MySQL R2DBC)" as repo
              component "Identity Provider" as idp
              component "External Adapter N" as ext
            }
            web --> uc
            scheduler --> uc
            msg --> uc
            uc --> entports
            entports --> repo
            entports --> idp
            entports --> ext
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
  node "Subred Privada" as priv {
    database "Amazon Aurora MySQL (RDS)" as rds
  }
}

internet --> ec2 : SSH 22\nHTTP 8080
mysqlAdapter --> rds : R2DBC MySQL 3306
ec2 --> dockerhub : HTTPS 443\n(docker pull)
cfn --> rds
note on link
Aprovisionamiento (API de AWS)
end note

note right of ec2
Security Group EC2:
- Entrantes: 22 SSH y 8080 HTTP desde mi IP
- Salientes: 443 a Internet (para Docker Hub)
end note

note right of rds
Security Group RDS:
- Entrantes 3306 MySQL solo desde el SG de la EC2
end note

note bottom of api
Variables de entorno:
- SPRING_R2DBC_URL=r2dbc:mysql://<endpoint>:3306/<db>
- SPRING_R2DBC_USERNAME=<user>
- SPRING_R2DBC_PASSWORD=<secret>
- (Opc.) SPRING_R2DBC_POOL_ENABLED=true
end note
@enduml

